OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon tourism tax capped at 5%,
OL,4,ABBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon's tourism levy will be capped at
OL,7,F5% of the cost of accommodation, the
OL,8,FBBC understands.
OL,10,FSir Sadiq Khan said he "strongly"
OL,11,Fwelcomed plans set to be formally
OL,12,Funveiled by the government later
OL,13,Fgranting mayors in England the power to
OL,14,Fset an uncapped overnight visitors'
OL,15,Flevy - often referred to as a tourism
OL,16,Ftax.
OL,18,FA source at City Hall told BBC London
OL,19,Fthat officials had not landed on an
OL,20,Fexact figure for the capital but that
OL,21,Fit would be no higher than 5%.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
