OL,3,GNEWSALondon tourism tax capped at 5%,
OL,4,ABBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn industry body said the levy could
OL,7,Fput tourists off visiting London, while
OL,8,FConservative-led Westminster Council
OL,9,Fcalled for boroughs to keep half the
OL,10,Ffunds raised in their area.
